      "message": "Let\u0027s also check the LOCK bit\n\nSeparately (not blocking), we should discuss the LOCK bit more. I wonder if we should set it in RW to prevent an attacker from modifying the PMP configuration. Obviously that will result in wrong RO PMP if we jump to RO, but I think it would work if we only reboot (reset) into RO.",
